		{
			description: [
				"Welcome to the modpack! This guide contains important things you should know."
				"Click the green arrow at the bottom left of the opened panel to go to the next page."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPONDER AND EMI:&r"
				"Hold &2&nW&r while holding certain items to open a screen called &aPonder&r, which teaches you how that item works."
				"Use &6EMI&r to view recipes and crafting recipes."
				"EMI is the thing on the left of your inventory that shows you the recipes (similar to JEI)"
				"It is highly recommended to use both of these features to figure out how things work."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"                     PONDER"
				"{image:ftbquests:textures/picture/ponder_showcase.png width:150 height:150 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"                       EMI"
				"{image:ftbquests:textures/picture/emi_showcase.png width:150 height:150 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lResearch System:&r"
				"In the RESEARCH section of the quest book are Researches. You &nsubmit&r items to the quest, which unlocks various items and recipes for you. Researches are mandatory for progression."
				"If you haven't unlocked something, it shows a little lock icon and tells you which research is required."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lVANILLA CHANGES:&r"
				"This modpack changes some core vanilla systems."
				""
				"- Enchanting tables are removed."
				"- Vanilla potion brewing is removed."
				"- Villagers and villages do not generate."
				"- Most surface structures have been removed."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lMULTIPLAYER:&r"
				"This modpack is meant to be played in singleplayer. Things may break if you play it on multiplayer."
